IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `la-legitimation`

-- Legitimacy Act 1934, ss 3, 4, 5, 7, 9, 10, 11 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_legitimacy-act-1934.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

